# Running tests

Use `node ace test` with the `dot` reporter. Run commands from the project root.

## All tests

```bash
node ace test --reporters=dot
```

## Single test file

Pass the file name (without path or `.spec.ts` extension) to `--files`:

```bash
node ace test --reporters=dot --files=battlecry
```

Examples:
- `tests/unit/game_actions/battlecry.spec.ts` → `--files=battlecry`
- `tests/unit/game_actions/minion_action.spec.ts` → `--files=minion_action`
